# Send only V3 build inputs; local migration scripts, snapshots, and credentials stay local.
**
!Dockerfile
!v3/
!v3/**
!web/
!web/app/
!web/app/**
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md

